# claude-toolbar

> HTML shelf for a Claude toolbar idea. Separate from the claude-* conversation archives.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/claude-toolbar.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for toolbar files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source.

## Key ideas
- Claude toolbar (the named shelf)
- HTML source

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-toolbar
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/claude-toolbar”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants a conversation archive → a claude-* repo
- If a reader wants this toolbar → stay on the source

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a toolbar door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
